## PRIMER 5: EventArgs - Kako prosljeđivatam podatke?

### Prilagojeni EventArgs:
```csharp
// Definiram custom EventArgs
public class PlaylistErrorEventArgs : EventArgs
{
    public string Sporocilo { get; set; }
    public ErrorType Tip { get; set; }
    
    public PlaylistErrorEventArgs(string sporocilo, ErrorType tip)
    {
        Sporocilo = sporocilo;
        Tip = tip;
    }
}

// Definiram event z EventArgs
public event EventHandler<PlaylistErrorEventArgs> PlaylistError;

// Ko je napaka, sproži event z podatki:
OnPlaylistError("Datoteka je duplikat", ErrorType.DuplicateItem);

// Handler dobi podatke:
private void playlist_PlaylistError(object sender, PlaylistErrorEventArgs e)
{
    string poroca = $"Napaka: {e.Sporocilo} (Tip: {e.Tip})";
    MessageBox.Show(poroca);
}
```

