## Primerjava: Brez Eventi vs S Eventi

### BREZ EVENTI - tesen coupled:
```csharp
// V Playlist klasi:
public class Playlist
{
    private Form1 form;  // Direktna referenco na Form1!
    
    public void Add(MediaItem item)
    {
        // ...
        form.UpdateUI();  // Tesen coupling!
    }
}

// Problem: Playlist je odvisna od Form1
// Če spremenimo Form1, moramo spremeniti tudi Playlist
```

### S EVENTI - slab coupled:
```csharp
// V Playlist klasi:
public class Playlist
{
    public event PlaylistChangedEventHandler PlaylistChanged;
    
    public void Add(MediaItem item)
    {
        // ...
        OnPlaylistChanged(...);  // Sproži event
    }
}

// V Form1 klasi:
public class Form1
{
    public Form1()
    {
        playlist.PlaylistChanged += playlist_PlaylistChanged;
    }
    
    private void playlist_PlaylistChanged(...)
    {
        UpdateUI();
    }
}

// Prednost: Playlist ne pozna Form1
// Playlist je nezavisen in ponovno uporabljiv v drugi aplikaciji!
```

